operation ${R}_{2}↔{R}_{3}$ to $A.$\n\nTo find $E,$ we apply the given row operation to the identity matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equivalent notation in terms of matrix multiplication is $EA:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "6480aa5b-ee2d-59de-9bc0-5718af92cb12" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501251}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501273 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501170 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63b5ca94-7c8e-5598-ba13-28752852bfd9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186500675} {:answer/id #uuid "73e152b8-77cd-51bf-ac4c-ac4a654611e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186500704} {:answer/id #uuid "aa17b4c3-3333-5dcb-aee8-13cca8125a67" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186500818} {:answer/id #uuid "b6a14f61-2fc3-556c-8f5f-f4e80923c57d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186500847} {:answer/id #uuid "bc57dbd1-cb18-5136-86e5-420e461ef7af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186500859}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186500675} :answer-field/id #uuid "a16204f8-f3d9-5011-8c48-c6b5f2